1
00:00:00,375 --> 00:00:01,418
The Giants,

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:03,378
three-time 
defending champions 

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:05,296
and the most dominant force in the league,

4
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:07,424
face off against the 
Knights today.

5
00:00:07,882 --> 00:00:09,676
They've 
been unstoppable 

6
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:10,844
under coach 
Ted Vincent

7
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:13,888
and have had 
thirteen straight wins.

8
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:16,850
So who will take home the trophy tonight?

9
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:18,643
Here we go, 

10
