and it is not 
looking good.

13
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:25,316
There is a serious 
gap in their strength.

14
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:27,527
The Giants 
defense holds firm.

15
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:29,571
They truly are the best.

16
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:31,197
This is not good. 

17
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:32,907
I knew their physical
stats were higher, 

18
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,117
