you can't choke yet.

22
00:00:39,914 --> 00:00:41,833
Three drives, can't 
even get twenty yards.

23
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,001
Fucking pathetic.

24
00:00:44,252 --> 00:00:45,587
Guess his luck ran out. 

25
00:00:45,712 --> 00:00:47,005
Now that he's 
facing real talent,

26
00:00:47,005 --> 00:00:47,714
